Description: BiBit desktop assistant frontend
 Tauri desktop frontend with CLI, status popup and Hermes ACP integration.
 On Bianbu riscv64 systems, EGL/GLES and PowerVR packages are supplied by
 the system archive rather than bundled into this package.
